tab}&var-agent=${agent}&var-model=${model}&${__url_time_range}\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #333842; background: #1c2027; color: #a6b2c4; margin-right: 6px; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">Cache hit rate</a>\n</div>",
